OL,3,GNEWSALuke Littler takes on amateurs for
OL,4,ANetflix show
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarts champion Luke Littler will
OL,7,Fchallenge members of the public in
OL,8,FManchester to a game of darts.
OL,10,FThe 19-year-old from Warrington is
OL,11,Finviting amateur players to take him on
OL,12,Fas part of a new Netflix show.
OL,14,FThe second and final regional auditions
OL,15,Ffor Beat Luke Littler will take place
OL,16,Fat Manchester Central Convention
OL,17,FComplex.
OL,19,FThe ticketed event will see thousands
OL,20,Fof contestants attempt to make the
OL,21,Ffinal 20 - who will appear on a live
OL,22,Fshow due to be broadcast on 30 October.
